Backend:
- app/registry.py: live settings registry (crew model, Kokoro voice, speech
  speed) with Ollama tag discovery, fuzzy spoken-name resolution ("qwen3 8b"
  -> qwen3:8b), engine hot-swap mirroring, settings.update broadcasts
